  wrote: results/geo/gse230574_tag_summary.csv 
 
  NO group test is run. Cells from one culture are not independent 
  replicates of their lesion type, and two runs cannot support a 
  melanocyte-vs-melanoma p value. Detection fraction per tag is the 
  honest readout, and its value is that a gene expressed in a small 
  subset of cells is invisible to bulk RNA-seq -- which is exactly 
  the scenario GSE109245 could not rule out. 

